Subject: [PATCH] tests: require A133 LEDC transfer status

Add driver-shaped red coverage for the release LED controller: a single
PIO burst completing with TRANS_FINISH on GIC SPI 35, a 64-word transfer
refilled through FIFO_CPUREQ and FIFO_WLW, abort by clearing LEDC_EN,
reset, QOM led-colors for two RGB_MODE values, and migration of a
half-finished transfer. The current inert stub fails these tests because
it absorbs writes in RAM storage with no FIFO, no latched status, no IRQ
and no advertised QOM path.

Assisted-by: LLM
